🧠 Why Interviewers Love This Problem

It tests:

Greedy thinking

Logical proof reasoning

Edge case handling

Optimization from brute force O(n²) to O(n)

❌ Wrong Approach (Common Mistake)

Trying each station as start → O(n²)

Interviewer expects O(n).

⚠ Edge Cases

Only one station

All values equal

Large arrays

total < 0 case

